<http://digistrucmed.org/text-unit/lu_66f14f762d9ed93be7e45532f52e341584cfa69a96a4b48ae6ab5277a1a358e7_n0020/tu_0013> <http://digistrucmed.org/verbatimText> "Influenza and pneumococcal vaccinations should be considered in order to prevent HF hospitalizations." .
